ICYMI: We had a blast at @token2049 Singapore.

But, it almost didn't happen…

@andyyy was rerouted twice, got stuck in Dubai, and finally made it to Singapore. Landed Wednesday 2pm and walked straight into the show with Tarun.

The thing is, Andy had all the production gear from The Tower in NYC.

So… @OddMaxxing jumped in last minute like he'd planned it for months.

He flew 30 hours to deliver the gear, telling his gf he’d “fill her in later” and proceeded to eat chicken legs in Singapore.

Think he told her about that?

@robbieklages carried the team all week. His rule: "If you're not having fun, you're not doing it right."

The haze was thick. We all smoked a pack of cigs for every hour outside and the timeline was in shambles (typical conference dump).

We did a full Quantum + Privacy Day with @NEARProtocol & @QuantusNetwork

OPEN with @monad

And of course, @blockworksDAS with @alpacaHQ

Some of our fav quotes:

@ilblackdragon on quantum: "We've designed NEAR with quantum in mind in 2018."

@EliBenSasson: "If Ethereum does not move fast enough, and I'm not sure it will."

@andyyy: "I know it's fear mongering, but this is a real threat."

@virtualbacon: "I sold my Robinhood coins to buy Quantus."

On tokenization:

@chriseyin: "Today the vast majority of dollars are just sitting around doing nothing."

@tomhschmidt on Pearl: "It's a block reward."

@CryptoHayes: "AI agents will run all of your financial services."

Plus @keoneHD, @arush, @vnovakovski, @FTDA_US and @StaniKulechov joined the show. Grayscale & SWIFT, as well.

Did someone say Rollup institutional?

What we took home:

Institutions are here. More suits than hoodies. Tokenized equities and t-bills are the first inning of the Tokenization Supercycle.

Quantum was the surprise of the week. Revenue dominates the conversations.

Same week, @citrini dropped Breaking The Wall. The tokenization supercycle isn't a pitch deck anymore.

It’s time to buy the f*cking tokens, Arthur says…

People kept calling us the most bullish people on the timeline.

@aave: "Be more bullish."

@TimHaldorsson: "The best media in Token2049 by far."

Then Verstappen won Singapore start to finish. Very on brand.

Thank you:

@NEARProtocol for co-hosting Privacy Day and tokenizing the Nasdaq. Busy week.

@QuantusNetwork for making a whole conference google "post-quantum."

@monad for starting our week at full speed. Literally.

@alpacaHQ for tokenizing the world & allowing us to be a Patagonian farmer alongside you all.

Be more bullish.

See you next year (in NYC, of course).

