Credit is going to be a big thing that grows in crypto and I think equities onchain is going to be a big trend

We've already seen:
Explosion in growth with equity perps - markets such as @tradexyz, @Lighter_xyz and @variational_io 
Explosion in growth in spot equities - issuers such as @xStocksFi, @Ondo, @coinbase and @RobinhoodCrypto 
I think we'll next see this growth in credit + options

@kamino currently dominates, with a growing market around @xStocksFi 
@aave just recently launching markets on V4 with coinbase equities 
@Morpho has actually been around the longest, I remember early SPYx markets but really not much traction at all. It's interesting because they have the robinhood eco to themselves, despite all the volume, not many interested in borrowing (there's $1m+ in borrow liquidity, but no borrows for major stocks)

This is all very interesting because you can borrow against your stocks onchain for less than 1% APR

I reckon this TVL will do multiples before the end of the year.

